 "remarks": "Your fabulous Shippan waterfront oasis awaits! This direct Long Island Sound waterfront retreat offers water views from almost every room and 75 feet of unobstructed frontage with a private beach perfect for boating, swimming, and relaxing. Totally renovated top to bottom, this sun-drenched home offers 4 bedrooms and 4 baths, breathtaking morning sunrises, and indoor/outdoor living optimized for seaside enjoyment. Minutes to vibrant downtown Stamford and the Stamford Metro-North station (approximately 50 minutes to NYC). Easy access to local yacht clubs and coastal amenities - an exceptional turn-key waterfront lifestyle. FLEXIBLE LEASE OPTIONS AVAILABLE! CHECK WITH LISTING AGENT FOR MORE DETAILS.",
